WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.468
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.468 --> 00:00:03.569
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.037
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:08.508
President Biden met today with
members of his administration

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.777
to discuss lowering
consumer prices

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:14.881
and also making sure both teams
get the ball in overtime.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:16.149
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:18.885
A federal judge in Texas
ruled on Friday

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:22.221
that President Biden could not
require federal workers

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:24.156
to receive
the coronavirus vaccine.

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:26.692
Wow. Nobody's letting Biden
get anything done.

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:28.327
At this point,
I wouldn't be surprised

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.864
if Wordle was only
giving him two rows.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.698
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:36.002
After the voting-rights bills
failed to pass last week,

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.204
White House press secretary
Jen Psaki

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:41.974
advised people who were upset
to go to a kickboxing class

00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:44.811
or have a margarita,
because what better way

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:48.281
to save democracy than
with fun ideas for first dates?

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:51.851
"They're stripping away
our rights, one by one!

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.920
Let's paint mugs!"

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.521
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:57.690
According to a new report,
Britain's Prince Andrew

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.126
had a collection
of more than 70 teddy bears,

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.061
and staff members were ordered

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.564
to arrange them
according to a diagram,

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:07.900
and then they could get to work
on his enormous collection

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.403
of giant red flags.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.373
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:17.743
The NFL reportedly notified
unvaccinated players last week

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:20.246
that they will no longer be
required to be tested daily

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.547
for the coronavirus.

00:01:21.547 --> 00:01:24.284
In fact, some of them don't even
have to come to work.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:26.419
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.688
A television reporter
in West Virginia

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:31.758
who was hit by a car during
a live broadcast last week

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:35.728
got up uninjured and said,
"That's live TV for you."

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:39.498
Okay, as someone who's done
a lot of live TV,

00:01:39.498 --> 00:01:41.534
no, it's not!

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.902
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:47.139
Ashlee Simpson lip-synching --
that's live TV for you.

00:01:47.139 --> 00:01:49.675
You got hit by a car!

00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:51.710
"oh, my God.
Should we exchange info?"

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.714
"No, no, it's fine.
This is live TV."

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:58.718
Rapper Jay-Z has reportedly
signed on to a letter

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:01.320
urging New York
Governor Kathy Hochul

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.956
and state lawmakers
to ban prosecutors

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:05.792
from using rap lyrics
as evidence

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:08.661
against defendants in court,
not because it's unfair,

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:12.465
just because it's so cringey
to hear lawyers recite them.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.899
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.899 --> 00:02:17.069
Singer Adele last week postponed
her Las Vegas residency

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:19.205
less than 24 hours
before the first show.

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:21.473
Fortunately, Adele fans
are well equipped

00:02:21.473 --> 00:02:23.543
to deal with sudden heartbreak.

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:26.145
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:28.314
And finally,
according to the latest numbers,

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:31.250
New Yorkers placed
more than $600 million in bets

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.419
during the first week
of mobile sports gambling,

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.655
all against the Knicks.

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.423
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

